<section id="faq" class="fade-up">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-container">
      <div class="section-label">Before you book</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Questions people usually ask first</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is Reiki a substitute for medical or psychological treatment?</summary><p>No. Reiki is a relaxation-focused energy practice and is offered alongside — never in place of — the care of your doctor or therapist. I don't diagnose or treat any medical condition.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>What does a session actually feel like?</summary><p>Most people describe warmth, a sense of heaviness or lightness in the body, or simply falling into a very deep rest. Some feel very little in the moment and notice the effect over the following day or two — both are common.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do I need to believe in energy work for it to be worthwhile?</summary><p>No. I ask clients to stay open, not convinced. Many of the people I work with are analytical by profession and approach it the same way — as an experience to test, not a belief to adopt.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Can sessions happen at my villa or on my yacht?</summary><p>Yes — this is the most requested format. I bring everything needed; all you need is a quiet room or deck and about an hour.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you work with children?</summary><p>Yes, with a gentler, shorter format designed for children who are anxious or struggling to settle — always alongside, not instead of, any medical or psychological care they're already receiving.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>I'm only here for a week — can you come to my hotel?</summary><p>Yes. Hotel rooms, rented villas and yachts at anchor are all fine; I bring everything. Same-day and next-day slots are often possible — write on WhatsApp and I'll tell you honestly what's free.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is it a good idea on the day I land?</summary><p>It's one of the best times. A session in the first 24–48 hours tends to settle the nervous system and bring sleep back that night — that's exactly what the Arrival Reset is for.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>How do I pay, and what if plans change?</summary><p>Card via a secure link, bank transfer or cash — whichever is easiest. Packages are paid before the first session. Rescheduling is free with 24 hours' notice.</p></details>
        <details class="faq-item"><summary>How does booking work?</summary><p>Leave your phone number, email and a few words about what's on your mind in the form below. I'll reply personally on WhatsApp within 24 hours to find a time.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
